WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
CITI-EM: We have a client asking about a local currency bond in the Brazil curve, seven year maturity.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Ola: Let me check our inventory and recent activity on that name.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Ola: We have not traded that specific line in a couple weeks, but I can get an indicative level.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
CITI-EM: That would help, the client is trying to gauge whether now is a good entry point.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Ola: Local rates have been fairly range bound the last two weeks, nothing dramatic either direction.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
CITI-EM: Good context, I will pass that along, they were worried about missing a move.

7
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Ola: Understandable, I will send over a firm two-way level within the hour.

8
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
CITI-EM: Perfect, that should be enough for them to make a decision today.

9
00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Ola: Sounds good, I will follow up once I have the level ready.

10
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:20.000
CITI-EM: Appreciate it, thanks for the quick turnaround.

11
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:40.000
Ola: No problem, talk soon.
